# Local secrets / environment. Real values live only in ignored files or a secret manager.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!backend/.env.example
# 1Password references (op://…), never values; `node tools/secrets/sync.mjs check` enforces it (ADR-493).
!.env.op
# The secrets sync tool's local record of what it last wrote to Vercel (fingerprints, no values).
secrets/.sync-state.json
secrets/.sync-state.json.tmp
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.xcconfig.local
